// CONTRACT BEAT (seeded by the lead; owned by east): asserts rivalFought(ferry).
// The Meridian sails from Tidewell to Portvolt; boarding needs the
// ferryTicket (south, gate ferryGangway). Kai got on first, of course.

## The gangway

::bg{location="ferry-meridian" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="upbeat" volume="normal"}
::auto{character="meridianSteward" anchor="left" action="enter"}
@meridianSteward{code="0010"}: Ticket, please. Ah, one of Cassius's guests. Welcome aboard the Meridian. The ballroom is aft, the crew quarters forward, and the captain is... indisposed.
::auto{character="meridianSteward" action="exit"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Meridian's deck is crowded with trainers in their best clothes. Somebody is playing a piano very badly below decks.

## The deck

::auto{character="rival" anchor="right" action="enter"}
@rival{code="0010" emotion="smug"}: Well, look who finally found the boat. I've been aboard since breakfast. I've beaten half the ballroom already.
@rival{code="0020"}: Cassius gave me a ticket too, you know. He said I had "remarkable drive". He didn't say what you had.
::use{component="rivalBattle" meet="ferry" intro="Bonjour! That's what they say on ships. Let's see how your monsters handle the swell!" win="Humph! At least you're raising your monsters. Somebody has to." lose="Heh! I've got the right stuff, and you don't. Get some sea legs." instance="use-001"}
@rival{code="0030" emotion="angry" when="@wonFight"}: Whatever. The ship rocked. That counts.
@rival{code="0040"}: The captain's seasick in his cabin. Go and hold his bucket. He teaches some cutting trick to anyone who helps. I'd do it, but I've got a gym to beat in Portvolt. Smell you later!
::auto{character="rival" action="exit"}
